      "source_note_text": "111\u03c9_ex_e= +0.7196(v+1/2)^3 - 0.0598(v+1/2)^4 +0.002l6(v+1/2)^5, Y_00 = 8.7; from a least squares fit Dabrowski and Herzberg, 1974 to the first eight levels as given by Herzberg and Howe, 1959. Wilkinson, 1968 gives slightly different constants based on the first five levels only. Monfils, 1968 and Namioka, 1964, 2 have observed levels up to v= 35 and 37, respectively, very close to the dissociation limit at 118377._6 cm^-1 Herzberg, 1970. The dissociation energy of the B ^1\u03a3_u^- state is 28174.2 cm^-1.",
